/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 421 0 R
/E (Li et al. \(2026\), Computer Methods in Applied Mechanics and Engineering. This paper integrates phase-field corrosion directly into topology optimization. Their method studies how the structure loses material and stiffness over time, then improves the design so that it can continue providing mechanical support after degradation. This is the closest existing study to our main optimization idea.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [197 0 R 5]
>>
