177 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 422 0 R
/E (Sun et al. \(2024\), Journal of Biomedical Engineering. This study designed a biodegradable fixation plate whose stiffness decreases as the material degrades. They then studied how this changing stiffness affects load transfer and bone remodeling. The paper supports our goal of matching implant degradation with bone healing, although remodeling was evaluated only after optimization.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [198 0 R 7]
>>
endobj
